abstract: >-
  Free, non-commercial academic data library for economic and financial time
  series, bringing together data from international organizations, national
  statistical offices, central banks, and research datasets hosted with written
  permission — surfaced through a curated, continuously-growing searchable
  catalog. Producer-first attribution ships with every download; access via
  website, free REST API, MCP server, and a Python client. Part of the
  ElkassabgiData family.
